        "id": 46440,
        "name": "dypaca",
        "username": "dypaca",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dypaca/{size}/2079_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-23T09:31:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Removing a static modifier is not the same thing as reducing damage.&nbsp; If damage is changed so that an increase no longer applies to it, then it loses the increase whether it is reducible or not.</p><p>With blighted streets Ambuscade would take 3 damage.&nbsp; With obsidian field he would take 4.</p>",
