        "id": 46450,
        "name": "TheJayMann",
        "username": "TheJayMann",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-26T00:29:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>An indirect official ruling was made by Adam in the topic \"Imbuied Fire vs Cramped Quarters Combat,\" where Adam stated the effects \"Increase fire damage by 1\" and \"all hero damage is fire damage\" are static, and are not activated by some trigger, but rather are both in effect at all times (until the card is destroyed).</p>",
